NOTICE — kovan-codegen
======================

Relicense: GPL-3.0-only -> AGPL-3.0-only (2026-10-07)
-----------------------------------------------------

Maintainer direction, 2026-10-07: "I want all kovan to be AGPLv3". Every
crate of the kovan family is AGPL-3.0-only from this date: kovan (since
2026-08-21), kovan-web (since its creation, 2026-10-06), and kovan-common,
kovan-literature, kovan-discovery, kovan-semantics, kovan-metrics and
kovan-codegen (this change).

Why: the planned port of Zotero (AGPL-3.0) into kovan and its libraries.
AGPL code cannot go into a GPL-3.0-only crate, so the libraries that receive
it must be AGPL; the maintainer chose to make the whole family AGPL rather
than confine the port to one crate.

Copyright: the maintainer holds the copyright of this crate's code. It was
checked for third-party code before the relicense (2026-10-07): none. ~~The
one "ported" module in the family's libraries, kovan-common's `fuzzy`, is
ported from the njoy TUI in this same workspace, same copyright holder.~~
CORRECTED 2026-10-07: that was true when the relicense was made; the Zotero
port (below) has since added third-party AGPL code. `fuzzy` remains ported
from the njoy TUI in this workspace, same copyright holder.

Versions already published on crates.io (kovan-codegen <= 0.0.1) stay
GPL-3.0-only; the AGPL applies from the next published version.

Dependents: no crate outside the kovan family depends on this one (checked
with `cargo metadata`, 2026-10-07); `dhoby-ghaut`, which depends on `kovan`,
has been AGPL-3.0-only since 2026-10-05.

Upstream: Zotero (2026-10-07, GitHub #747, #748)
------------------------------------------------

`src/zotero/` generates kovan-common's Zotero schema tables from Zotero's
schema. It follows the order in which the Zotero client registers fields and
creator types (zotero xpcom/schema.js `_updateGlobalSchema`) and the CSL
tables of Zotero utilities' schema.js `Schema.init`. Zotero is free software
under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later; this crate
takes it under AGPL-3.0-only.

